# Tests, their fixtures and the repo's tooling never reach the image (#1770): the pgTAP tests and vendored pgTAP
# (#1627, #1643), every test directory and test file, the end-to-end suite, and tools/ (CI, deploy and backup
# scripts run from a checkout, and the backup scripts mount tools/backup into the container rather than read it from
# the image). The image check fails if a test file or one of these directories is in it. The root package's
# prepare script runs tools/install-git-hooks.mjs on every install (it does nothing outside a git checkout), so that
# one file stays.
supabase/tests
**/test
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.mts
**/*.test.cts
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.jsx
**/*.test.mjs
**/*.test.cjs
e2e
tools
!tools/install-git-hooks.mjs
